<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 6.759 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 6.759 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS200 million   6.759	 6.75-6.76   6.796</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$200 million, pct allotted at top 96)</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS200 million   6.886	 6.84-6.90   6.852</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$100 million, pct allotted at top 52)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS500 million   6.688	 6.66-6.71   6.747</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up A$300 million, pct allotted at top 80)</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
